OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer jailed for raping
OL,4,Awoman in 2002
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Yorkshire Police officer has
OL,7,Fbeen jailed for raping a woman.
OL,9,FPC Joe Lavender, who was working in the
OL,10,FLeeds district at the time of his
OL,11,Fsuspension, assaulted the woman in
OL,12,F2002. He had joined as a police staff
OL,13,Fmember earlier that year and became a
OL,14,Fpolice officer in 2005.
OL,16,FThe 45-year-old, from Castleford, was
OL,17,Ffound guilty of rape following a
OL,18,Fretrial in October.
